<title>USA: Mentor monthly div from net investment.</title>
<headline>Mentor monthly div from net investment.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mentor Income Fund Inc said on Tuesday its monthly dividend for December from current and accumulated net investment income is seven cents per share to holders of record December 16 1996.</p>
<p>The dividend, of the same amount as its previous monthly dividend from current and accumulated net investment income, is payable on December 31.</p>
<p>Mentor, a closed-end investment fund with primary investments in fixed-income securities, was unchanged at 9-1/8 in late morning trading.</p>
</text>
